T1319	Entity 208702 208704	he
T1320	Cue 208705 208709	said
T1321	Entity 208722 208732	his nephew
T1322	Quotation 208734 208835	"Don't be troublesome; mind you obey Nastasya Petrovna. . . . Good-bye; I am coming again to-morrow."
T1323	Quotation 210218 210269	"We have no time for tea! We are just setting off."
T1324	Quotation 210422 210429	"Well,"
T1325	Cue 210430 210435	began
